#. Description of the plugin
#: shadow-software-crypto-for-woocommerce.php
msgid "A simple, free, open-source plugin to confirm common blockchain transactions (USDT/USDC/BTC/ETH) and mark orders paid in Woocommerce. Enter your own receiving addresses; customers pay them directly and the payment is confirmed on-chain with free public nodes and explorers before the order is marked paid. No middleman, no fees, no keys on your server."
msgstr ""

